<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 16px">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="640" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:640px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:16px">
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 32px 24px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23">Hello Nasir,</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The contractor program page is built in Lovable from your prompt. It&#x27;s a new page on the VEXTRON Apex Systems project at /contractor-program, with its own header and footer. The site&#x27;s menu and other pages are unchanged; the two site-wide changes are listed below.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Next decisions</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Let me know if these changes are OK.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F4F1FD" style="background-color:#F4F1FD;border:1.5px solid #5B45C2;border-radius:16px;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#5B45C2" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#5B45C2;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">?</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Should I proceed with further fine-tuning of the page, or publish it as it is right now?</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Preview (Lovable sign-in): <a href="https://id-preview--744ab6e8-ec42-442c-92ab-93e23b287fd3.lovable.app/contractor-program" style="color:#2E4A66;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#AFC0D1;font-weight:500;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:normal">https://id-preview--744ab6e8-ec42-442c-92ab-93e23b287fd3.lovable.app/contractor-program</a></p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 24px 0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dmqyhwiwu/image/upload/c_scale,w_1152,q_auto/v1791436162/contractor-program_desktop.png" width="576" alt="Contractor program page, desktop" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:576px;height:auto;border:1px solid #E3E6E8;border-radius:8px"><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Contractor program page, desktop</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#EAF4EE" style="background-color:#EAF4EE;border-left:3px solid #2F6B4F;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#2F6B4F" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#2F6B4F;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">✓</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Built as written: all 5 sections, your colors, fonts and wording, and every bracketed placeholder kept. The form validates email, phone and license #, saves each application with the UTM tags and time, and shows the thank-you message. Test entries were deleted.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Brief vs. built</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#EDF1F5" style="background-color:#EDF1F5;border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#2E4A66;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Placement · Info</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">A single page: no other pages, no nav menu.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: /contractor-program, a new page on the existing VEXTRON project, with its own header and footer and no site menu.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: It lives on vextrons.com and uses the site&#x27;s existing lead database.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Logo · Changed</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">The attached VEXTRON shield PNG.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: The shield logo already in the project, with its white background removed for this page.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: The logo was already in the project, and its white square showed on the dark page.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Browser-tab icon · Added · site-wide</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Not in the prompt.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: The shield logo is now the browser-tab icon on every page of the site.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: Applied by Lovable while preparing the logo.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#8A6414;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Packages · Added · site-wide</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Not in the prompt.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: A routine security update to the app&#x27;s packages.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: Applied by Lovable during the build.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#EAF4EE" style="background-color:#EAF4EE;border-left:3px solid #2F6B4F;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#2F6B4F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Spacing · Fixed</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Not in the prompt.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Built: A small spacing fix on this page.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#80888F">Why: The same spacing issue showed up on the Cool Roof ROI page and was fixed on both.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">What&#x27;s left</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Content</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Next training class date and location, for [DATE · LOCATION].</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Content</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Response time for the thank-you message, for [X] business days.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Content</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">The contractor testimonial: name, company and city.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Analytics</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Google Analytics ID (G-XXXXXXX). The generate_lead event is set up but sends nothing until it&#x27;s connected.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir · Decision</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Keep the shield as the site-wide browser-tab icon, or revert it.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad · Speed</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Run the mobile Lighthouse test against the 90+ target. Not run yet.</p></td></tr><tr><td height="8" style="height:8px;line-height:8px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F8E9E5" style="background-color:#F8E9E5;border-left:3px solid #9A4A3A;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#9A4A3A;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad · Launch</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">Publish to vextrons.com after your approval.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
